{
  "name": "dsh-theme-firefly",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "崩坏：星穹铁道 · 流萤主题 —— 精简定制版：固定 firefly3 壁纸、萤火绿按钮与 12 颗星点，高亮和滚动条使用流萤银灰；Windows 顶栏与窗口按钮统一深空底色；侧栏单层 55% 不透明 + 4px 磨砂、底部 24px 淡出；设置窗口暖浅灰底与深色文字；会话区单层 40% 不透明与官方圆角，实色输入卡片、透明外围及正文裁切",
  "author": "motionalpha84",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/motionalpha84/dsh-desktop_theme-firefly.git"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "prepack": "node build.cjs --clean"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "theme",
    "firefly",
    "honkai-star-rail"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme"
      ]
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "contributors": [
    {
      "name": "Liu-ZA-81",
      "url": "https://github.com/Liu-ZA-81"
    }
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/motionalpha84/dsh-desktop_theme-firefly#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/motionalpha84/dsh-desktop_theme-firefly/issues"
  }
}
